OL,3,GNEWSA'People will talk about the day
OL,4,Athe Tour of Britain came through'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunities across North Yorkshire are
OL,7,Fpreparing to welcome the Tour of
OL,8,FBritain men's cycling race on Saturday.
OL,10,FThe fourth stage of the men's tour will
OL,11,Fstart in Helmsley, with the cyclists
OL,12,Ftravelling through Ripon on their way
OL,13,Fto the Yorkshire Dales before finishing
OL,14,Fin Leyburn.
OL,16,FStretching approximately 103 miles
OL,17,F(166km) with 8,800ft (2,699m) of
OL,18,Felevation, it is expected to be the
OL,19,Frace's most challenging day and "could
OL,20,Fplay a key role in deciding the overall
OL,21,Fwinner" of the competition, according
OL,22,Fto British Cycling.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
