OL,3,GNEWSA'People will talk about the day
OL,4,Athe Tour of Britain came through'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlmost #10,000 has been awarded to
OL,7,Ftowns and villages along the route to
OL,8,Fenable them to create community
OL,9,Fdisplays and decorations celebrating
OL,10,Fthe race's visit to the area.
